# ── Local secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real environment files anywhere in the project — they hold
# passwords and client secrets. Only the *.example templates are committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example

# Common local/editor noise (subprojects keep their own build ignores).
.DS_Store
*.log
